<![CDATA[
811.9;+696,;.01~VA-BL NSG URINARY CATH INDWELL ON ADMISSION
811.9;+696,;1.2~Indwelling Urinary Cath on Admission
811.9;+696,;2~WP-start~5
This reminder definition will look at the current date and time and
compare to the admission date and time of an inpatient, it will be DUE
NOW if the patient is an inpatient and the current fileman date and time
is less than 25 hours from admission.  It will be resolved if the 
indwelling urinary catheter present on admission has been addressed.
